# Appelo, Parkhurst, and Post (2014), Figure 3B documented worst-fit point:
# 0.93 mol/kg NaCl + 1.36 mol/kg CaCl2 at 5 C, measured rho=1154.1 kg/m3.
# This interpretation reproduces the paper's stated measured mixed-salt
# molar volume of approximately 12.2 cm3/mol.
GEOCHEM
Temp 5
Pres 1.01325e5
debug 0

SOLUTION 0
pH 7 charge
Na 0.93
Ca 1.36
Cl 3.65
/end

chemtol
1e-8 1e-5
/end

/end
